<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>New Order Alert</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { background: #f4f6f9; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #333; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 32px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #e94560; color: #fff; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; }
    .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 6px; }
    .body { padding: 36px 40px; }
    .ref-box { background: #fff5f7; border: 2px solid #e94560; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .ref-box .ref-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #e94560; }
    .ref-box .ref-value { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a2e; }
    .section-title { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .info-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .info-item p:first-child { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .info-item p:last-child { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1a2e; word-break: break-word; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    th { text-align: left; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: #888; padding: 8px 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0; }
    td { padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f5f5f5; font-size: 14px; }
    .product-name { font-weight: 600; }
    .total-row td { border-bottom: none; padding-top: 16px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; color: #1a1a2e; }
    .cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 28px; }
    .cta a { display: inline-block; background: #1a1a2e; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 8px; }
    .footer { background: #f8f9fa; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #999; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🔔 New Order Received!</h1>
      <p>A customer just placed an order on Njiani Electricals</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <div class="ref-box">
        <div>
          <div class="ref-label">Reference</div>
          <div class="ref-value">{{referenceNumber}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="section-title">Customer Details</p>
      <div class="info-grid">
        <div class="info-item"><p>Name</p><p>{{customerName}}</p></div>
        <div class="info-item"><p>Phone</p><p>{{customerPhone}}</p></div>
        <div class="info-item"><p>Email</p><p>{{customerEmail}}</p></div>
        <div class="info-item"><p>Location</p><p>{{customerLocation}}</p></div>
        <div class="info-item"><p>Channel</p><p>{{channel}}</p></div>
        <div class="info-item"><p>Notes</p><p>{{notes}}</p></div>
      </div>

      <p class="section-title">Items Ordered</p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Product</th>
            <th style="text-align:center">Qty</th>
            <th style="text-align:right">Unit Price</th>
            <th style="text-align:right">Subtotal</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each items}}
          <tr>
            <td class="product-name">{{productName}}</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">{{quantity}}</td>
            <td style="text-align:right">{{unitPriceFormatted}}</td>
            <td style="text-align:right">{{subtotalFormatted}}</td>
          </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
        <tfoot>
          <tr class="total-row">
            <td colspan="3" style="text-align:right">Total</td>
            <td style="text-align:right">{{totalAmount}}</td>
          </tr>
        </tfoot>
      </table>

      <div class="cta">
        <a href="http://localhost:3502/orders">View in Admin Panel →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; 2024 Njiani Electricals Limited — Internal notification</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
